{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-06-15 09:00:00', 'title': "AT-RISK MEDI-CAL MEMBERS GET ACCESS TO VACCINATIONS THROUGH HEALTH NET'S UNIQUE CARE COLLABORATION", 'text': "INNOVATIVE INSURER AND HEALTH EQUITY PIONEER WORKS WITH MEDARRIVE TO PROVIDE VULNERABLE MEDI-CAL MEMBERS AND THEIR FAMILIES ACCESS TO IN-HOME COVID-19 VACCINATIONS SACRAMENTO, CALIF. , JUNE 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HEALTH NET , ONE OF CALIFORNIA'S LONGEST SERVING AND MOST EXPERIENCED MEDI-CAL PARTNERS, IS OFFERING IN-HOME COVID-19 VACCINATIONS TO ITS MOST VULNERABLE MEMBERS AND THEIR FAMILIES."}